      "rest_url": "https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-json/tribe/events/v1/events/23629",
      "title": "MSE Open House Featuring DuPont",
      "description": "<p>Join the Department of Materials Science and Engineering (MSE) as we welcome DuPont! Explore materials science and engineering careers and participate in hands-on activities. Bring your resume to be entered into a raffle.</p>\n<p>Open to Engineering students curious about MSE, product development, manufacturing, sustainability, and careers at DuPont.</p>\n<p>Meet DuPont starting at 3:00 p.m. All undergraduates curious about MSE are welcome to stay to hear more about MSE and DuPont starting at 5 p.m. &#8211; refreshments will be served.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23663\" src=\"https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"777\" srcset=\"https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-791x1024.png 791w, https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-232x300.png 232w, https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-768x994.png 768w, https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-1187x1536.png 1187w, https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-1583x2048.png 1583w, https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-309x400.png 309w, https://events.engineering.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-MSE-Open-House_higher-res-scaled.png 1978w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /></p>",
